    "Below-detection and censored results remain qualified/censored and are never converted to zero.",
    "Grab, time-composite and flow-proportional composite samples retain distinct collection-method identities.",
    "A sample aliquot, lab split, duplicate, source event and household/site are different units; preserve their parent-child links.",
